sd":null},{"k":"25:28","t":"Oh, woe to me! I wish I had not taken that one as a friend.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"25:29","t":"He led me away from the remembrance after it had come to me. And ever is Satan, to man, a deserter.\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"25:30","t":"And the Messenger has said, \"O my Lord, indeed my people have taken this Qur’ān as [a thing] abandoned.\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"25:31","t":"And thus have We made for every prophet an enemy from among the criminals. But sufficient is your Lord as a guide and a helper.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"25:32","t":"And those who disbelieve say, \"Why was the Qur’ān not revealed to him all at once?\" Thus [it is] that We may strengthen thereby your heart. And We have spaced it distinctly.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":32,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":37,"surahs":[25],"sajdah":false}